-5f13-93e4-3c9b1d034520" 13194139535416 true] [17592186348146 1145 "To compute the velocity vector, we need to integrate the acceleration vector:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}v(t) & =\\int a(t)\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =\\int ⟨3\\sqrt{t},\\,-\\frac{4}{\\sqrt{t+1}}⟩\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =⟨\\int 3\\sqrt{t}\\,\\text{d}t,\\int -\\frac{4}{\\sqrt{t+1}}\\,\\text{d}t⟩ \\\\  & =⟨2t\\sqrt{t}+{C}_{1},-8\\sqrt{t+1}+{C}_{2}⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can solve for the constants of integration using the fact that $v(0)=⟨2,-1⟩.$ Substituting $t=0,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}v(0) & =⟨2\\cdot 0\\cdot \\sqrt{0}+{C}_{1},-8\\sqrt{0+1}+{C}_{2}⟩ \\\\ ⟨2,-1⟩ & =⟨{C}_{1},-8+{C}_{2}⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, we must have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2 & ={C}_{1} \\\\ {C}_{1} & =2,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nand\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-1 & =-8+{C}_{2} \\\\ {C}_{2} & =7.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the velocity vector is\n\n$$\nv(t)=⟨2t\\sqrt{t}+2,\\,-8\\sqrt{t+1}+7⟩.\n$$" 13194139535416 true] [17592186348147 1000 #edb/ref 17592186348148 13194139535416 true] [17592186348147 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139535416 true] [17592186348147 1041 "field-1" 13194139535416 true] [17592186348147 1104 #edb/ref 17592186348148 13194139535416 true] [17592186348147 1110 #uuid "e62cf4a6-e02e-58ce-a91e-eece38f6cccb" 13194139535416 true] [17592186348148 1034 "2t\\sqrt{t}+2" 13194139535416 true] [17592186348148 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535416 true] [17592186348148 1111 #uuid "534b0141-590b-55f0-be64-d7ee4d209642" 13194139535416 true] [17592186348149 1000 #edb/ref 17592186348150 13194139535416 true] [17592186348149 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139535416 true] [17592186348149 1041 "field-2" 13194139535416 true] [17592186348149 1104 #edb/ref 17592186348150 13194139535416 true] [17592186348149 1110 #uuid "3e7c8c57-4581-5f6e-8aaf-dffbea8f4593" 13194139535416 true] [17592186348150 1034 "7-8\\sqrt{t+1}" 13194139535416 true] [17592186348150 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535416 true] [17592186348150 11